    "结果不一致！\n- AOT: Loop sum: 10, Multiple loops: 5, 5\n- PHP: Loop sum: 45, Multiple loops: 10, 10\n\n这是循环展开的 bug。让我检查生成的代码：\n[Tool uses: execute_bash]",
