    "让我直接分析 IR 的控制流图。问题可能在于某个块的跳转形成了环。让我画出控制流：\n\n从 IR 看：\n- Block 11 (for_body_10) → 根据条件 → Block 14 (if_then_13) 或 Block 15 (if_merge_14)\n- Block 14 (if_then_13) → Block 13 (for_exit_12)\n- Block 13 (for_exit_12) → Block 8 (for_loop_7)\n- Block 8 (for_loop_7) → Block 6 (for_cond_5)\n- Block 6 (for_cond_5) → 根据条件 → Block 7 (for_body_6) 或 Block 9 (for_exit_8)\n- Block 7 (for_body_6) → Block 10 (for_cond_9)\n- Block 10 (for_cond_9) → 根据条件 → Block 11 (for_body_10) 或 Block 13 (for_exit_12)\n\n**找到循环了！**\n\n当 `$k == 1` 时：\n1. Block 11 → Block 14 (if_then_13)\n2. Block 14 → Block 13 (for_exit_12)\n3. Block 13 → Block 8 (for_loop_7) - j++\n4. Block 8 → Block 6 (for_cond_5) - 检查 j < 3\n5. Block 6 → Block 7 (for_body_6) - 进入 j 循环体\n6. Block 7 → Block 10 (for_cond_9) - k = 0\n7. Block 10 → Block 11 (for_body_10) - 进入 k 循环体\n8. Block 11 → 输出，然后又检查 `$k == 1`...\n\n但 k 已经是 0 了，不应该等于 1。让我看看是不是 k 没有正确递增。\n\n等等，我发现问题了！看 Block 7：\n\n```\nfor_body_6:\n  .{ .id = 12, .type_ = .{ .i64 = void } } = const.i64 0\n  store .{ .id = 12, .type_ = .{ .i64 = void } } to .{ .id = 13, .type_ = .{ .ptr = .{ .php_value = void } } }\n  br for_cond_9\n```\n\n这是 **k = 0** 的初始化！每次进入 j 循环体时，k 都会被重置为 0。这是正确的。\n\n那问题在哪里？让我看看 `$k == 1` 的条件何时为真。第一次迭代：\n- i=0, j=0, k=0 → 输出 \"000 \"\n- 检查 k==1 → false\n- 检查 j==1 && k==0 → false\n- k++ → k=1\n- 检查 k<3 → true\n- i=0, j=0, k=1 → 输出 \"001 \"\n- 检查 k==1 → **true** → break → 跳到 for_exit_12\n- for_exit_12 → for_loop_7 (j++)\n- j=1\n- 进入 j 循环体 → k=0\n- i=0, j=1, k=0 → 输出 \"010 \"\n- 检查 k==1 → false\n- 检查 j==1 && k==0 → **true** → break 2 → 应该跳到 for_exit_8\n\n让我看 `break 2` 对应的 IR：\n\n```\nif_then_15:\n  br for_exit_8\n```\n\n这是正确的！`break 2` 跳到 `for_exit_8`（j 循环的出口）。\n\n让我看 `for_exit_8`：\n\n```\nfor_exit_8:\n  br for_loop_3\n```\n\n这也是正确的！j 循环退出后，应该执行 i 循环的 loop 部分（i++）。\n\n那为什么会死循环？让我重新检查生成的代码。可能是代码生成时块编号错了：\n[Tool uses: execute_bash]",
